      <title>特朗普电话参加英伟达董事会会议：已就国家安全问题作出保证</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261124-113048&amp;cat=general&amp;event=evt_ce95917ad0f0</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261124-113048:evt_ce95917ad0f0</guid>
